Use aes_string. The issue is that aes expects a unqouted var name. names returns a quoted character string.

df <- data.frame(var1=rnorm(20), var2=rnorm(20))

funcplot <- function(x) {

  ggplot(x, aes_string(x = names(x)[1], y = names(x)[2])) + geom_point()
}

funcplot(df)
Luciano

